{
    "background_story": "Rylie grew up in the mountains, where snow-covered peaks and frozen lakes were her playground. As a child, she would watch in awe as her grandfather, a seasoned outdoorsman, trekked through the deep snow with ease, his snowshoes leaving behind a trail of perfectly spaced prints. Inspired by his adventures, Rylie learned to snowshoe at a young age and quickly fell in love with the freedom and serenity it brought her. As she grew older, Rylie became an expert snowshoer, exploring the backcountry and discovering hidden gems that few others knew existed. Her passion for snowshoeing led her to become a guide, sharing her knowledge and love for the sport with others. Rylie's adventures took her to the most breathtaking winter landscapes, where she found solace and peace in the stillness of the snowy wilderness.",
